            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Derogatory notations reflecting oral or written warnings shall not be used in support of any disciplinary or adverse action after three (3) years from the date such warnings were issued, provided that no additional derogatory notations have been placed in a unit member's personnel file in the three (3) year period.",
            "block_bbox": [
