        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. A supervisor may create private files on employees which include such things as documents and notes kept for purposes of evaluation. Such a file does not constitute an official personnel file. The existence of such a file on an employee shall be made known to that employee, who in turn, shall have the right to review the file upon request and to initial acknowledgement of each item entered in the file.",
            "block_bbox": [
                94,
                243,
                711,
                390
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    94.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    711.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    711.0,
                    390.0
                ],
                [
                    94.0,
                    390.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Should, prior to the time for the employee's regularly scheduled performance evaluation, there be a change of supervisor, because either the employee transfers to another position or the supervisor is replaced by another individual, an interim evaluation shall be prepared by the departing or former supervisor based upon the employee's work in the evaluation period up to that point in time. A copy of this interim evaluation shall be provided to the employee and may also be provided to the new supervisor.",
            "block_bbox": [
                94,
                402,
                711,
                597
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    94.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    711.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    711.0,
                    597.0
                ],
                [
                    94.0,
                    597.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Any supervisor file maintained on an employee and forming the basis for an interim evaluation remains the private property of the departing or former supervisor and may not be provided to the new supervisor. Nor does the interim evaluation become part of the official personnel file except upon the written request of the employee.",
            "block_bbox": [
